# Case study: forged signatures, repeated events and a bad deploy
# bareproxy 0.16.0, built with go1.27.3, 2026-10-31 10:40:12 UTC, Linux x86_64

## Config

global
  admin /work/admin.sock
  state /work/state
  trace-log /work/requests.log 10MB 2

site http://hooks.test:33945
  route /hooks/github -> inbox github
  route /hooks/shopify -> inbox shopify
  route /hooks/stripe -> inbox stripe

inbox github
  deliver app
  signature github /work/github-secret
  key-header X-GitHub-Delivery
  retry 2s 10s
  give-up 30s

inbox shopify
  deliver app
  signature shopify /work/shopify-secret
  key-header X-Shopify-Webhook-Id
  retry 2s 10s
  give-up 30s

inbox stripe
  deliver app
  signature stripe /work/stripe-secret
  retry 2s 10s
  give-up 30s

pool app
  backend 127.0.0.1:47009

## What an inbox route does

$ bareproxy explain -c /work/bareproxy.conf POST http://hooks.test:33945/hooks/github
